  "silent": true,
  "notes": [
    "Where an app's brokered actions POINT, and where its credential is typed in. Both belong to the shell: a token an app collects is a token an app has held, however briefly, and a destination an app can choose is not a boundary. This panel is the reason `git:write` is reachable by a person rather than only by a test."
  ]
}
